{'symbol': 'TRMB', 'date': '2023-03-30 08:30:00', 'title': 'TRIMBLE LAUNCHES FIRST INDUSTRY DWELL TIME METRICS FOR FLEET MANAGEMENT', 'text': 'METRICS HELP IMPROVE DELIVERY, SCHEDULING AND DRIVER UTILIZATION WESTMINSTER, COLO. , MARCH 30, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TRIMBLE (NASDAQ: TRMB) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT TRIMBLE FLEET MANAGER, PROVIDED AS PART OF ITS MOBILITY TELEMATICS PORTFOLIO, IS NOW THE FIRST BACK-OFFICE FLEET MANAGEMENT SOLUTION TO OFFER INDUSTRY-SPECIFIC AVERAGE DWELL TIME METRICS.'}